WEBVTT

00:07:28.152 --> 00:07:32.490
nearly 245 million dollars in aid.

00:07:33.282 --> 00:07:39.205
(Applause)

00:07:39.788 --> 00:07:41.582
It wasn't easy

00:07:41.624 --> 00:07:43.709
and it wasn't without hiccups.

00:07:44.293 --> 00:07:48.547
But by working with these
unlikely partnerships,

00:07:48.589 --> 00:07:51.634
we were able to help

00:07:51.675 --> 00:07:56.805
more than two and a half million
war victims and still counting.

00:07:57.681 --> 00:08:01.769
(Applause)